function ksbValidUploadBytes_(mime,bytes){ksbRequire_(['image/jpeg','image/png','application/pdf'].indexOf(mime)>=0,'Hanya JPG, PNG, atau PDF');ksbRequire_(bytes.length>0&&bytes.length<=KSB_CFG.MAX_UPLOAD_BYTES,'File terlalu besar (maks 4 MB)');var jpeg=bytes[0]===-1&&bytes[1]===-40&&bytes[2]===-1,png=bytes[0]===-119&&bytes[1]===80&&bytes[2]===78&&bytes[3]===71,pdf=bytes[0]===37&&bytes[1]===80&&bytes[2]===68&&bytes[3]===70;ksbRequire_(mime==='image/jpeg'&&jpeg||mime==='image/png'&&png||mime==='application/pdf'&&pdf,'Jenis file dan kontennya tidak sesuai.');}
function ksbUploadAuthorization_(actor,type,entityId){if(type==='PRODUCT'){var p=ksbRow_('PRODUCTS',entityId);ksbRequire_(p,'Produk tidak ditemukan');ksbOwnStore_(actor,p.store_id);return 'PUBLIC';}if(type==='PAYMENT'){var pay=ksbRow_('PAYMENTS',entityId),o=pay?ksbRow_('ORDERS',pay.order_id):null;ksbRequire_(o&&o.buyer_id===actor.id,'Bukti pembayaran bukan milik pengguna');return 'PRIVATE';}if(type==='DELIVERY'){var d=ksbRow_('DELIVERY_ORDERS',entityId),courier=d?ksbRow_('COURIERS',d.courier_id):null;ksbRequire_(courier&&courier.user_id===actor.id,'Hanya kurir pemilik order dapat mengunggah bukti');return 'PRIVATE';}ksbFail_('Kategori unggahan tidak valid');}
function ksbFileUpload_(actor,args){
 var type=ksbString_(args.entityType,30),entityId=ksbString_(args.entityId,90),visibility=ksbUploadAuthorization_(actor,type,entityId),filename=ksbString_(args.fileName||'upload',150).replace(/[<>\\/]/g,'_'),mime=ksbString_(args.mime,60),encoded=String(args.base64||'');
 ksbRequire_(encoded.length<=Math.ceil(KSB_CFG.MAX_UPLOAD_BYTES*4/3)+1000,'File terlalu besar');
 var bytes=Utilities.base64Decode(encoded);ksbValidUploadBytes_(mime,bytes);
 if(type==='PRODUCT')ksbRequire_(mime.indexOf('image/')===0,'Foto produk harus JPG atau PNG');
 return ksbWithLock_(function(){
   if(type==='PRODUCT')ksbRequire_(ksbProductActiveImagesV7_(entityId).length<5,'Maksimum 5 foto aktif per produk. Hapus foto lama dahulu.');
   var blob=Utilities.newBlob(bytes,mime,ksbId_('FILE')+'_'+filename),file=ksbAssetFolder_().createFile(blob);
   try{
     if(visibility==='PUBLIC')file.setSharing(DriveApp.Access.ANYONE_WITH_LINK,DriveApp.Permission.VIEW);
     var id=ksbId_('ATT');ksbAppend_('FILE_ATTACHMENTS',{id:id,entity_type:type,entity_id:entityId,owner_id:actor.id,file_id:file.getId(),mime:mime,name:filename,visibility:visibility,created_at:ksbNow_()});
     if(type==='PRODUCT')ksbAppend_('PRODUCT_IMAGES',{id:ksbId_('IMG'),product_id:entityId,file_id:file.getId(),sort_order:ksbProductActiveImagesV7_(entityId).length,created_at:ksbNow_(),removed_at:''});
     ksbAudit_(actor.id,'UPLOAD','FILE',id,{type:type,mime:mime});return {id:id,entityId:entityId,imageUrl:visibility==='PUBLIC'?ksbImageUrl_(file.getId()):null};
   }catch(e){try{file.setTrashed(true);}catch(ignore){}throw e;}
 });
}
function ksbProductActiveImagesV7_(productId){return ksbFilter_('PRODUCT_IMAGES',function(i){return i.product_id===productId&&!i.removed_at;});}
function ksbProductPhotosV7_(actor,args){var p=ksbRow_('PRODUCTS',args.productId);ksbRequire_(p,'Produk tidak ada.');ksbOwnStore_(actor,p.store_id);return ksbProductActiveImagesV7_(p.id).map(function(x){return {id:x.id,url:ksbImageUrl_(x.file_id)};});}
function ksbProductPhotoRemoveV7_(actor,args){var i=ksbRow_('PRODUCT_IMAGES',args.imageId),p=i?ksbRow_('PRODUCTS',i.product_id):null;ksbRequire_(p,'Foto tidak ditemukan.');ksbOwnStore_(actor,p.store_id);return ksbWithLock_(function(){i=ksbRow_('PRODUCT_IMAGES',i.id);ksbRequire_(i&&!i.removed_at,'Foto sudah dihapus.');ksbPatch_('PRODUCT_IMAGES',i.id,{removed_at:ksbNow_()});try{DriveApp.getFileById(i.file_id).setTrashed(true);}catch(e){console.error('Cleanup gambar gagal '+i.id+': '+e.message);}ksbAudit_(actor.id,'REMOVE_PRODUCT_IMAGE','PRODUCT',p.id,{imageId:i.id});return {ok:true,productId:p.id};});}
function ksbFileRead_(actor,args){var a=ksbRow_('FILE_ATTACHMENTS',args.attachmentId);ksbRequire_(a,'File tidak ditemukan');ksbRequire_(a.owner_id===actor.id||a.visibility==='PUBLIC'||actor.roles.indexOf('ADMIN')>=0,'File pribadi tidak dapat diakses.');var blob=DriveApp.getFileById(a.file_id).getBlob(),bytes=blob.getBytes();ksbRequire_(bytes.length<=8*1024*1024,'File terlalu besar untuk unduh via Apps Script');return {name:a.name,mime:a.mime,base64:Utilities.base64Encode(bytes)};}
function ksbPdfRead_(actor,args){var inv=ksbRow_('INVOICES',args.invoiceId);ksbRequire_(inv&&(inv.party_id===actor.id||actor.roles.indexOf('ADMIN')>=0),'Invoice tidak dapat dibuka');var user=ksbRow_('USERS',inv.party_id),items=ksbFilter_('INVOICE_ITEMS',function(i){return i.invoice_id===inv.id;});var doc=DocumentApp.create('KSB GO Invoice '+inv.id),body=doc.getBody();body.appendParagraph('KSB GO + KSB RUTE').setHeading(DocumentApp.ParagraphHeading.HEADING1);body.appendParagraph(inv.invoice_type==='STATEMENT'?'LAPORAN MITRA':'INVOICE TAGIHAN');body.appendParagraph('Nomor: '+inv.id);body.appendParagraph('Mitra: '+user.display_name+' ('+user.email+')');body.appendParagraph('Periode: '+inv.period_start+' s.d. '+inv.period_end);body.appendParagraph('Siklus: '+inv.cycle+' | Status: '+inv.status);var table=[['Keterangan','Nominal (Rp)']];items.forEach(function(i){table.push([i.description,String(i.amount)]);});if(items.length)body.appendTable(table);body.appendParagraph('TOTAL: Rp '+Number(inv.total).toLocaleString('id-ID'));body.appendParagraph('DIBAYAR: Rp '+Number(inv.paid).toLocaleString('id-ID'));body.appendParagraph('SISA: Rp '+Number(inv.balance).toLocaleString('id-ID'));body.appendParagraph('Terbit: '+inv.issued_at+' | Jatuh tempo: '+inv.due_date);body.appendParagraph('Dokumen dihasilkan dari catatan internal. Verifikasi transaksi dengan mutasi bank.');doc.saveAndClose();var file=DriveApp.getFileById(doc.getId()),pdf=file.getAs(MimeType.PDF);file.setTrashed(true);return {name:'KSB-GO-'+inv.id+'.pdf',mime:'application/pdf',base64:Utilities.base64Encode(pdf.getBytes())};}
